# Secrets — must never reach an image layer
**/.env
**/*-key.json
**/service-account*.json

# Build output and caches
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.vite

# Local runtime state
backend/.blobs
eval/images
eval/output

# Not needed at runtime
backend/tests
docs
eval/*.md
.git
.github

# NOTE: do not add a blanket **/*.md rule here. The agent prompts in
# backend/app/agents/prompts/ are markdown and are loaded at runtime; excluding
# them builds an image where every agent fails to start.
